      "narration_text": "Here is what the subagent actually is. My session — the main one — is a window filling up with everything I read. The subagent is a second window. I ask it a question; it reads whatever it needs, in its own window; it hands me back a summary. Its reads never enter my window. Only the summary does. That's the whole trick — and the whole promise.",
